<title>JAPAN: Chubu Gas to issue 3 bln yen CB.</title>
<headline>Chubu Gas to issue 3 bln yen CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Chubu Gas Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Nomura Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p>TRUSTEE - Tokai Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE convertible	    ISSUE NO   1     AMT   3 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON 0.75%(tentatively) ISS PRICE PAR    MATURITY 30.Dec.03</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 1.Nov.96   CONV TO 29.Dec.03</p>
<p> LAST MOODY	     PAY DATE 18.Sep.96  INT PAY end Jun/Dec</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 11.Sep-17.Sep</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon and conversion price will be decided on September 10.</p>
</text>
